  "description": "Wires DatadogNet into any Microsoft.Extensions host, no MAUI required: AddDatadog registers\n      IRumMonitor, IDatadogLogs, IDatadogLogger, IDatadogTracer and ISessionReplay for constructor\n      injection, an ILogger provider forwards Microsoft.Extensions.Logging output to Datadog, and\n      AddDatadogTracking instruments a named or typed HttpClient. DatadogNet.Maui builds on this\n      package; reference it directly from a plain .NET Android or iOS app, a service, or a test\n      host.",
